<style>
  .seo-content {
    background: #f9f9f9;
    padding: 50px 20px;
  }
  .seo-content__inner {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .seo-content__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px 50px;
  }
  .seo-content__block {
    padding: 28px 0;
  }
  .seo-content__block--full {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    padding-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .seo-content__block h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .seo-content__block p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #555;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .seo-content__block p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .seo-content__block strong {
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }
  .seo-content__block a {
    color: #1a1a1a;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .seo-content__block a:hover {
    color: #c0392b;
  }
  .seo-content__links {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    padding-top: 28px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .seo-content__links p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #777;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .seo-content {
      padding: 36px 16px;
    }
    .seo-content__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0;
    }
    .seo-content__block {
      padding: 22px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
    }
    .seo-content__block--full {
      grid-column: 1;
    }
    .seo-content__block h2 {
      font-size: 19px;
    }
    .seo-content__block p {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .seo-content__links {
      grid-column: 1;
      padding-top: 22px;
      border-top: none;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="seo-content">
  <div class="seo-content__inner">
    <div class="seo-content__grid">

      <div class="seo-content__block seo-content__block--full">
        <h2>Affordable Furniture Store in Louisville, KY</h2>
        <p><strong>Bubba's Mattress &amp; Furniture</strong> is Louisville's go-to destination for quality, affordable home furnishings. Located at <strong>5907 Terry Rd in Louisville, KY 40216</strong>, we carry a huge selection of <strong>Ashley Furniture</strong> products including sofas, sectionals, bedroom sets, mattresses, dining room furniture, recliners, and more — all priced well below big box retailers.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="seo-content__block">
        <h2>No Credit Check Financing — Starting at $40 Down</h2>
        <p>We believe everyone deserves a comfortable home. That's why we offer <strong>no credit check furniture financing</strong> with payments starting at just <strong>$40 down</strong>. Whether you need a new mattress, a complete bedroom set, or a living room makeover, our easy approval process gets you the furniture you need today without the hassle.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="seo-content__block">
        <h2>Why Louisville Chooses Bubba's</h2>
        <p>Since 2021, families across Louisville, Shively, Valley Station, Pleasure Ridge Park, and surrounding areas have trusted Bubba's for honest prices and real value. We offer <strong>$125 flat-rate delivery within 50 miles</strong>, free pickup, a friendly no-pressure shopping experience, and financing options that work for every budget. Stop by our showroom or call <a href="tel:5024940376"><strong>(502) 494-0376</strong></a> to see why our customers rate us <strong>5 stars on Google</strong>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="seo-content__links">
        <p>Have questions? Check out our <a href="/pages/faq">frequently asked questions</a>, learn about <a href="/pages/financing">no credit check financing</a>, or <a href="/collections/all">browse our full furniture catalog</a>.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "SEO Text",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "SEO Text" }]
}
{% endschema %}
